{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You died... and now you're a ghost! Stranded in purgatory with no idea how to tackle your own issues,\u00a0you decide to open up a cafe to chat with other ghosts and the grim reaper, and maybe learn a bit more about yourself! You can be free from purgatory only if you've finally found peace in the life you lived after all...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cook up delicious pastries for your ghostly customers and chat with them to learn more about them and their stories in this dialogue focused cooking simulator game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Features</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free to play with ~1 hour worth of content</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >22 ghosts with unique stories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 unique cooking minigames</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 unique music tracks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute 3D models</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 Grim Reaper Therapist!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is best played with a keyboard and mouse.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3963000?t=1770424607","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3963000?t=1770424607","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963000/b6449b8476bf954e19a17c62a81e2ffa169ce63a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770424607","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963000/b6449b8476bf954e19a17c62a81e2ffa169ce63a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770424607","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You died... and now you're a ghost! Stranded in purgatory with no idea how to tackle yo